  <running_head>THEOD. BEZÆ</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="heading" level="1" para="true">IOSIÆ. SIMLERI TIGVRI</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="1">ni,eruditiff. Theologi,&amp; renouatoru</l>
    <l n="3" type="heading" level="1">tum Arianorum, tum Eutychianort</l>
    <l n="4" type="heading" level="1">fortiff.inter aliosdomitoris,Memori</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">
      <i>Simlere,mi Simlere,quo superstite</i>
    </l>
    <l n="6">
      <i>Tot mortui reuixerant.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="7" para="true">
      <i>Quos ira nobis Numinis tam pauculis</i>
    </l>
    <l n="8">
      <i>Ademit annis plurimos,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="9" para="true">
      <i>Simlere,quem tremuit renatus Arrius,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">
      <i>Tremuit renatus Eutyches,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11" para="true">
      <i>Vastator ille Poloniæ,hic Germaniæ,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>Lasti flagella Numinis.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13" para="true">
      <i>Heu,subita &amp; immatura te mors auferens,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>Quam multa tecum sustulit!</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15" para="true">
      <i>Lamenta amicis quanta,quot iustissimos</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>Secum dolores attulit!</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17" para="true">
      <i>Quosinter,ecce Beza quondam haud ultimus</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18">
      <i>Hisirrigat te lacrymis.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19" type="heading" level="1" para="true">CASPARIS OLEVIANI</l>
    <l n="20" type="heading" level="1">Treuirensis Theologi,doctrina, pieta-</l>
    <l n="21" type="heading" level="1">te,innocentia vitæ insignis,fratris</l>
    <l n="22" type="heading" level="1">con iunctiff.Memoriæ.</l>
    <l n="23" para="true">
      <i>Heu,quibus suspiriis,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24">
      <i>Eheu,quibus te lacrymis,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25" para="true">
      <i>Oleuia</i>
    </l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Right edge of both columns is cut off by the scan; words truncated at the edge are left as far as legible. Last line of the page is cut off. Doubtful: "Lasti" possibly "Lassi"; "Oleuia" is a truncated name, probably Oleviani.</notes>
